digraph account_payable_process_3 {
	graph [rankdir=LR]
	START_NODE [label="" shape=circle width=0.3]
	subgraph CLUSTER_0 {
		"file a copy for internal records" [shape=box]
		"create a receiving report" [shape=box]
		"file a copy for internal records" -> "create a receiving report"
		"gather the vendors invoice" [shape=box]
		"create a receiving report" -> "gather the vendors invoice"
		"stamp all documents" [shape=box]
		"gather the vendors invoice" -> "stamp all documents"
	}
	START_NODE -> "file a copy for internal records"
	END_NODE [label="" shape=doublecircle width=0.2]
	"stamp all documents" -> END_NODE
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The following description is about the account payable process. It starts with filing a copy for internal records. 
After filing a copy for internal records, you need to create a receiving report.
After creating a receiving report, you need to gather the vendors invoice.
When gathering the vendors invoice is completed, stamping all documents should be done. 
The process is now completed. 
"
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The following is a description of the account payable process and starts with filing a copy for internal records.
After storing a copy for internal records, you need to create a receipt report.
After creating a receiving report, you need to gather the invoice from the vendor.
If the completion of the vendor invoice is completed, the stamping of all documents should be done.
The process is now completed.
"
}
